            "review_title": "Review at Chocovine - Chocolate Cafe Wine",
            "review_text": "Linh\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nChocolate\nJul 2026 • Solo\nI visited Chocovine for the first time and was impressed with the menu here. The drinks are very rich, especially the Homemade Hot Choco and Matcha lines are aromatic, tasteful and not sweet.\n\nThe big plus is that the restaurant has a very salty menu: from burger, steak to pasta. Beautiful, cosy space, suitable to go on a date or sit chill with friends. The price is reasonable compared to the quality of service.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten July 23, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
